# Secrets. These carry the production database password and the EVE SSO client
# secret, so the rule is deny-by-default with a single explicit exception for
# the committed template. The parent monorepo has an equivalent rule, but this
# is a separate repository and cannot rely on it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Compiled binaries (plus the `ek` symlink).
bin/

# Local docker-compose state (postgres, valkey, memgraph). Reproducible from
# `docker compose up` plus the SDE importer, so it is never committed.
.data/
